meta {
  name: The agent machine reports its local SSH opt-in and host key
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

put {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/shell/agent
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "enabled": false,
    "mode": "string",
    "max_sessions": 0,
    "host_key": "string",
    "version": "string"
  }
}

docs {
  The agent mailbox's own credential only (capability token or device credential). The first host key is pinned; a different one waits as pending until a supervisor approves it (status host_key_pending). Disabling, or changing mode, ends open sessions.
}
